  "title": "TWFG Inc. to Report Second Quarter 2024 Results",
  "summary": "THE WOODLANDS, Texas, Aug. 21, 2024 /PRNewswire/ — TWFG Inc. (“TWFG” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: TWFG), announced today that it will report its second quarter 2024 financial and operating results after the market close on Tuesday, Aug 27, 2024. The Company will hold a conference call to discuss the results at 9am ET on August […]",
